    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Compile all audit screenshots, battery inspection reports, fuel readings, and FASTag scans into a single PDF. Attach this to the IRCTC bike parcel booking confirmation and upload to the train’s cargo tracking system. This ensures seamless handover for two‑wheeler transport services and instant updates for the customer.</p>
